WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.967
Last, the government-cloud
check, read on November 6,

2
00:00:03.967 --> 00:00:07.325
2026 and rechecked
before each new partner.

3
00:00:07.325 --> 00:00:09.280
For an agency tenant in GCC,

4
00:00:09.280 --> 00:00:14.434
entitlement management and connected
organizations are available,

5
00:00:14.434 --> 00:00:19.411
and a partner in GCC High or DoD
connects as Entra ID in another cloud,

6
00:00:19.411 --> 00:00:22.788
with both tenants enabling
each other's cloud.

7
00:00:22.788 --> 00:00:27.868
B2B direct connect isn't supported across
clouds, and Teams doesn't support external

8
00:00:27.868 --> 00:00:32.876
members across clouds, so check each
application's government service description.

9
00:00:32.876 --> 00:00:35.362
Cross-cloud sync carries users only.

10
00:00:35.362 --> 00:00:38.424
Several things are honestly
marked not verified.

11
00:00:38.424 --> 00:00:41.768
Whether cross-cloud sync
is generally available:

12
00:00:41.768 --> 00:00:45.763
one Microsoft page called it
public preview in August 2025.

13
00:00:45.763 --> 00:00:48.813
The FedRAMP boundary rules
for each feature used.

14
00:00:48.813 --> 00:00:51.937
The records schedules for
agreements and reviews.

15
00:00:51.937 --> 00:00:57.451
And the SP 800-63C-4 planning note.

16
00:00:57.451 --> 00:00:59.838
Confirm each before you rely on it.

17
00:00:59.838 --> 00:01:05.037
The chapter, the record and the Entra
profile carry every command and footnote.

18
00:01:05.037 --> 00:01:05.860
Thank you.
